  "description": "The temple of the god B\u0113l-m\u0101t\u0101ti (Enlil), Enamtila (\u201cHouse of Life\u201d), was located in the Kumar district of Babylon, in the western half of the inner city. According to the Babylonian topographical text Tintir = Babylon Tablet IV, it was one of seven temples in that part of Babylon. Enamtila is mentioned in Old Babylonian and Kassite Period texts.",
